      "value": "@{5c1fb4eab8b4ae10c4922bb3|full_name}: I have the same issue. I was told they won't have a possible fix out until Monday. My friend and I have to block and unblock each other every time we enter a world together, and then when it doesn't show an avatar, we just have to click through the options to show avatar/hide avatar/use safety settings until the other person appears. And sometimes after that, it won't load in, so you may have to switch avatars and then switch back.",
      "viewerReactions": null
